# Narset, Parter of Veils (five loyalty, no plus ability of her own) is in play when Way of the Pyromancer arrives on turn 3, and now has
# "[+1]: Add {R}": activating it makes her loyalty 6 and a red mana. Her own -2 is then refused for the turn, one loyalty ability per
# planeswalker (CR 606.3), while the Jace token Way empowers may use a loyalty ability of its own that turn. The enter trigger resolves
# first (turn 3), then both +1 and -1 are used on separate planeswalkers.

